			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Bump Rust dependency versions across workspace\n\nUpdate Cargo.toml to align with latest stable releases for core libraries and tooling. Key updates include:\n\n- **OXC Toolchain:** Bump all `oxc_*` crates from v0.129.0 to v0.132.0 for the Rest bundler, ensuring compatibility with latest JavaScript/TypeScript parsing and minification features.\n- **Security & Stability:** Patch `rustls` ecosystem (`tokio-rustls`, `rustls-pemfile`), `git2` (v0.20.4 → v0.21.0), and `sysinfo` to address potential vulnerabilities and improve platform stability.\n- **CLI & Config:** Upgrade `config` to v0.15.23 and `clap` to v4.6.1 for improved configuration parsing and CLI argument handling in Mountain/Air.\n- **Additions:** Introduce `prettyplease`, `quote`, and `syn` to support advanced code generation tasks within the build pipeline.\n\nThese updates maintain the Land editor's dependency health without altering architectural contracts.",
			"SHA": "0dfc21429aa19d376b3f145bf1d9aac2951d2af0"
		},
